msgid "运行进度"
msgstr "Progress"


# Trading, dialogue and identity cards
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_D34F20700273"
msgid "\n本次停留 {0} 周期，剩余 {1} 周期。底部进度条表示本次停留的剩余比例；不超过2周期为黄色，不超过1周期为红色。\n"
msgstr "\nVisit duration: {0} cycles; remaining: {1} cycles. The bar shows the fraction of this visit remaining; yellow at 2 cycles or less, red at 1 cycle or less.\n"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_29EEAC9D4748"
msgid "    较上周期 "
msgstr "    vs. last cycle "

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_65F262CA52A0"
msgid "    较前次报价 "
msgstr "    vs. previous quote "

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_DB40DE77E4A8"
msgid " · 接收 {0} {1}"
msgstr " · Receives {0} {1}"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_3C7094460B0C"
msgid " · 每周期价格走势"
msgstr " · Price history by cycle"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_421F465DAEE8"
msgid " 件"
msgstr " units"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_EADA23F062D8"
msgid "#{0} · 第 {1} 周期\n{2} #{3} · {4}"
msgstr "#{0} · Cycle {1}\n{2} #{3} · {4}"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_30E12A23B389"
msgid "<b>{0} {1}</b>    {2} #{3}\n数量 {4} {5} × ¥{6}    <b>预计总额 ¥{7}</b>\n预计余额 ¥{8} → ¥{9}\n{10}"
msgstr "<b>{0} {1}</b>    {2} #{3}\nQuantity {4} {5} × ¥{6}    <b>Estimated total ¥{7}</b>\nEstimated balance ¥{8} → ¥{9}\n{10}"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_4242349E33B3"
msgid "<color=#{0}>收入 ¥{1}</color>  <color=#{2}>支出 ¥{3}</color>"
msgstr "<color=#{0}>Income ¥{1}</color>  <color=#{2}>Spending ¥{3}</color>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_2AB28769EA70"
msgid "AI只生成台词或建议已有选项，不能自行改价格、生成物品、结算交易或写存档。"
msgstr "AI may generate dialogue or suggest existing choices, but cannot change prices, create items, settle trades or write saves."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_F23E40F78F37"
msgid "{0}\n供货商剩余买入额度 {1} / {2}；剩余卖出额度 {3} / {4}"
msgstr "{0}\nSupplier purchase budget {1} / {2}; supply budget {3} / {4}"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_BECA349C1FC7"
msgid "{0} {1} · 单价 ¥{2}"
msgstr "{0} {1} · Unit price ¥{2}"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_EA3C0C11A4B9"
msgid "{0} · {1} #{2}\n收购余额 ¥{3} · 供货余额 ¥{4}\n"
msgstr "{0} · {1} #{2}\nPurchase budget ¥{3} · Supply budget ¥{4}\n"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_1A3FD60C3681"
msgid "{0}{1} {2} {3}{4}，金额 ¥{5}；{6}。"
msgstr "{0}{1} {2} {3}{4}, amount ¥{5}; {6}."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_ED339CF1295B"
msgid "“{0}现在没有其他在场供应商的现货可比。打开市场走势看参考价，但参考价不是成交价。”"
msgstr "“{0} has no stock available from another visiting supplier for comparison. Check the market history for a reference price; it is not an executable quote.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_0C46F7A9ABFF"
msgid "“{0}这批现货有 {1} {2}，现在买入报价 ¥{3}。先看仓库接不接收，再决定数量。”"
msgstr "“I have {1} {2} of {0} in this batch, currently quoted at ¥{3} to buy. Check whether your storage accepts it before choosing a quantity.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_B3D88D69E37C"
msgid "“下一站还没定。等这里的货交接完，就去下一处需要它们的地方。现在看看进度条，别错过这一趟。”"
msgstr "“My next stop is not decided yet. Once the cargo here is handed over, I will head somewhere that needs it. Check my time bar so you do not miss this visit.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_E71ECF517B17"
msgid "“下一项想了解什么？我会把条件说完整。”"
msgstr "“What would you like to know next? I will explain the conditions fully.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_3215D059738C"
msgid "“你先把网络里的货卖给我换货币，再挑想买的。收购和供货各有独立额度；买回去之前，记得给在线仓库留出空间并检查过滤器。”"
msgstr "“Sell your network stock to me for currency, then choose what to buy. Purchasing and supply have separate budgets. Before buying, leave room in online storage and check its filters.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_B9E5F7055429"
msgid "“先别挂频道，我还没开始讲最糟糕的那次靠港呢。”"
msgstr "“Do not disconnect yet. I have not even told you about my worst docking attempt.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_493FD77935B2"
msgid "“包装混杂，报价也按批次来。先看看其他人的价格，你会知道哪些值得装进仓库。”"
msgstr "“The packaging is mixed, and each batch has its own price. Compare the other suppliers first; you will see which ones are worth storing.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_AE00B4548D6C"
msgid "“又见面了。上次聊得不错，这次也给你留点好报价的余地。”\n"
msgstr "“Good to see you again. We got along last time, so there is room for a better quote this visit.”\n"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_FE0AB9C57403"
msgid "“同类货船也会有不同的货单和报价。看看走势，再比较其他供应商；大批买卖还会影响后续价格，别把眼前报价当成永远不变。”"
msgstr "“Suppliers in the same category can carry different goods and quote different prices. Check the history and compare ships. Bulk trading affects later prices, so today's quote will not last forever.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_F04710FC0460"
msgid "“少见的东西未必便宜。我有几批急着出手的货，价签会告诉你是哪几批。频道热闹起来，我就走了。”"
msgstr "“Unusual goods are not always cheap. I have a few batches to move quickly; their price tags will tell you which ones. Once the channel gets busy, I leave.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_3A7F778E26A6"
msgid "“我们以前通过话。这次有新的货单，想从哪里聊起？”\n"
msgstr "“We have spoken before. I have a new cargo list this time. Where shall we start?”\n"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_11583608B093"
msgid "“我在听。货物、价格或者行程，都可以问。”"
msgstr "“I am listening. Ask about goods, prices or my route.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_62FB35E6A0F5"
msgid "“我走过建设中的矿区，也去过货仓满得关不上门的地方。航线常换，所以每次能带来的东西也不一样。”"
msgstr "“I have visited developing mines and warehouses too full to close their doors. Routes change often, and so does the cargo I can bring.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_E358576572EF"
msgid "“我这边没有可比较的现货，先看看其他货船的货单吧。”"
msgstr "“I have no stock to compare right now. Check the other ships' cargo lists first.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_2BF76BADCBFB"
msgid "“拿{0}来说，我的买入报价 ¥{1}；{2}现在报 ¥{3}。数量、余额和仓库容量也得一起看。”"
msgstr "“Take {0}: my buy quote is ¥{1}, while {2} quotes ¥{3}. Remember to consider quantity, your balance and storage capacity too.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_DF51BEB28A20"
msgid "“换你选话题。我也想听听这边的事。”"
msgstr "“You choose the topic. I would like to hear about this place too.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_0263DB47DFD0"
msgid "“既然你愿意直接谈生意，这次到访的买卖报价都按原价的 {0}% 算。成交仍受现货、余额和各自额度限制。”\n“你决定，接受之前报价不会变。”"
msgstr "“Since you want to talk business directly, this visit's buy and sell quotes can be {0}% of the original price. Stock, your balance and separate budgets still apply.”\n“You decide. Prices will not change until you accept.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_0F1C7A97F325"
msgid "“旧仓库，旧朋友。”他把这句话说得很快。\n“货单上的数量就是我这次能拿出来的，想要更多，下次再说。”"
msgstr "“Old warehouses, old friends,” he says quickly.\n“The cargo list shows all I can offer this visit. If you need more, ask next time.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_CACF2DF2D76C"
msgid "“有些仓库已经换了主人，货却还在。”他停了一下。\n“我只负责把它们运到需要的地方。”"
msgstr "“Some warehouses have new owners, but the goods are still there.” He pauses.\n“I just take them where they are needed.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_95010B7859F1"
msgid "“有些批次我要尽快清走，报价会低一点。别以为整张货单都一样便宜，也别等我走了再联系。”"
msgstr "“I need to clear some batches quickly, so their prices are lower. Do not assume the whole cargo list is cheap, and do not wait until I leave to call.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_F44D5FADB33A"
msgid "“朋友，货单之外也有故事。你想听哪一段？”"
msgstr "“Friend, there are stories beyond the cargo list. Which would you like to hear?”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_53E72FB2E66D"
msgid "“现在手里没现货了。看看下周期能补多少，或者去问问其他货船。”"
msgstr "“I have no stock left now. See what I can replenish next cycle, or ask another ship.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_45652C25CC3A"
msgid "“现货就在货单上。少量补货会在新周期到来时更新，但我的交易额度不会跟着恢复。你卖给我的东西，也会进入我的现货。”"
msgstr "“Available stock is on the cargo list. A little is replenished each cycle, but my budgets do not reset. Anything you sell to me also becomes my stock.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_FF8217B76AEC"
msgid "“船还能修，生意还能谈。你想先说哪件？”"
msgstr "“The ship can still be repaired, and we can still do business. Which shall we discuss first?”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_82A9CBABB707"
msgid "“菜单还能聊几句。至于厨房的名字，留在频道外就好。”"
msgstr "“We can talk about the menu a little longer. The kitchen's name stays off this channel.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_4F0677357C55"
msgid "“行情每周期都会变。大家的货单不同，报价也不同；大批买卖会改变后续报价。走势可以看看，但别把它当成下一周期的保证。”"
msgstr "“Prices change each cycle. Cargo and quotes vary between ships, and bulk trades affect later quotes. Check the history, but do not treat it as a promise for next cycle.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_254E7ED8D3C2"
msgid "“说定了。这次到访按原报价的 {0}% 合作，离站后结束。货单和走势已经更新。”"
msgstr "“Agreed. This visit's quotes are {0}% of their original price until I depart. The cargo list and price history have been updated.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_49AEE6C13416"
msgid "“货的事情可以继续说。别把时间花在箱子上的旧字上。”"
msgstr "“We can keep discussing the cargo. Do not waste time on old lettering on the crates.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_139D1520BEF8"
msgid "“还有什么要核对的？一次说清。”"
msgstr "“What else needs checking? Let us settle it at once.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_F86E6E618B9D"
msgid "“还有哪一项需要说明？我很乐意继续。”"
msgstr "“Is there anything else I should explain? I am happy to continue.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_A65088932EB0"
msgid "“还有问题就问，咱们把这一站的事办利索。”"
msgstr "“Ask if you have more questions. Let us finish this stop efficiently.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_06BD48A64EB4"
msgid "“这次只做{0}这一类。现货会逐周期少量补充，不过额度不会恢复。”\n“我还能收购 ¥{1} 的货，供货额度剩 ¥{2}。”"
msgstr "“I only trade {0} this visit. A little stock is replenished each cycle, but budgets do not reset.”\n“I can still purchase ¥{1} of goods, and my remaining supply budget is ¥{2}.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_16EAEBAA3A8C"
msgid "“这次已经给过合作报价了，再谈也还是同一个价。”"
msgstr "“I have already offered a cooperation price this visit. Asking again will not change it.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_FFA946E89B92"
msgid "“这站我总共停留 {0} 周期。具体剩余时间看我的进度条提示就行。离开后，再来的船会有自己的货单和额度。”"
msgstr "“I am staying {0} cycles in total. Check my time bar for the remaining time. The next ship will have its own cargo and budgets.”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_563E9C427519"
msgid "“那就按货单上的原价来。还有别的问题吗？”"
msgstr "“Then we will use the original cargo-list prices. Any other questions?”"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_50B06EDB1623"
msgid "”\n“这一趟，我想"
msgstr "”\n“This trip, I want to "

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_CF4B950F4F9B"
msgid "● 买入 ¥{0}/{1}"
msgstr "● Buy ¥{0}/{1}"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_F5FBBB974756"
msgid "● 卖出 ¥{0}/{1}"
msgstr "● Sell ¥{0}/{1}"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_6534D3B0220D"
msgid "● 市场参考价 ¥{0}/{1}"
msgstr "● Market reference ¥{0}/{1}"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_93192E1DBBFB"
msgid "。本次停留的收购、供货额度独立计算；逐周期少量补货，额度不会恢复。"
msgstr ". Purchase and supply budgets are separate for this visit; small replenishments occur each cycle, but budgets do not reset."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_A7E483D8298D"
msgid "一边说话一边拧紧旧工具的螺丝"
msgstr "tightens the screws on an old tool while talking"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_2B7CD9F92A76"
msgid "上一笔交易正在处理，请稍后再试。"
msgstr "The previous trade is being processed. Please try again shortly."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_C9B9AE7A6144"
msgid "上一页"
msgstr "Previous"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_8A8542F69648"
msgid "下一页"
msgstr "Next"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_CD8320E6E420"
msgid "不保证下一周期的价格"
msgstr "No promises about next cycle's prices"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_FAC4810B54C7"
msgid "不同批次的包装混在一起。他说是周转货，离站时间却催得很紧。"
msgstr "Different batches have mixed packaging. He calls it turnover cargo, yet seems in a hurry to leave."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_11D5B7E071BD"
msgid "不承诺货单外的库存"
msgstr "No promises of goods outside the cargo list"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_3412A30636EC"
msgid "不直接声明隐蔽身份，不主动公开渠道；通过动作、回避和措辞给线索。信任提高也不自动公开上家姓名。"
msgstr "Do not explicitly reveal the hidden identity or disclose supply channels. Hint through actions, evasions and wording. Increased trust does not automatically reveal suppliers' names."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_6557F12E4B05"
msgid "不着急，我们可以把货单和条件慢慢说清。"
msgstr "No rush. We can go through the goods and conditions carefully."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_DA8F6D2288E6"
msgid "不许诺下一站或下一周期的货单"
msgstr "No promises about the next stop or next cycle's cargo"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_7D6AB165F5B4"
msgid "不追问来历，聊聊下一站"
msgstr "Do not press for origins; ask about the next stop"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_2915E346FED3"
msgid "与不愿公开身份的厨房合作，食物渠道与标签上的信息并不完全一致。"
msgstr "Works with kitchens that do not want their identities disclosed; the supply channels do not fully match the labels."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_302849133797"
msgid "专营{0}，{1}；以实际货单和本次额度为准。"
msgstr "Specializes in {0}; {1}. Actual cargo and visit budgets take precedence."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_D868FC75D6AB"
msgid "丰收：食物降价"
msgstr "Harvest: food prices down"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_64DFD010E6DA"
msgid "临时反悔"
msgstr "Changing plans at the last minute"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_2CD2507D65DE"
msgid "买"
msgstr "Buy"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_A1557EC3B077"
msgid "买入"
msgstr "Buy"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_72690153CA27"
msgid "买入 ¥{0}/{1}    卖出 ¥{2}/{3}"
msgstr "Buy ¥{0}/{1}    Sell ¥{2}/{3}"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_C8ADD72E1E6A"
msgid "买入区间 ¥{0}～¥{1}    卖出区间 ¥{2}～¥{3} · {4}"
msgstr "Buy range ¥{0}–¥{1}    Sell range ¥{2}–¥{3} · {4}"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_D8D7A6452DE9"
msgid "买入数量"
msgstr "Buy quantity"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_62F98E846C6F"
msgid "交付到 {0} 个仓库"
msgstr "Deliver to {0} storages"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_919DDBBD91C0"
msgid "交易"
msgstr "Trade"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_10F0573B8AD7"
msgid "交易与对话效果仍由游戏逻辑检查当前供应商、时间、选项和额度。"
msgstr "Game logic must still validate the current supplier, time, choice and budgets before applying dialogue or trade effects."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_289A3F2079CF"
msgid "交易市场尚未初始化。"
msgstr "The trading market has not initialized yet."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_9CCE2B30D8B1"
msgid "交易数量小于最小成交量。"
msgstr "The quantity is below the minimum trade amount."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_18D410AF9EDE"
msgid "从{0}的货物交接做起，后来独立经营{1}航线。习惯先检查货物，再与当地仓库核对需求。"
msgstr "Started handling cargo at {0}, then began an independent {1} route. Checks the goods before discussing local storage needs."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_FB67EF22D3B4"
msgid "从网络仓库出售 · 可售 {0} {1}\n生产订单已预留的材料不会出售。"
msgstr "Sell from network storage · Available {0} {1}\nMaterials reserved for production orders will not be sold."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_81E7B99834F2"
msgid "仓库周转出来的一批货，包装不统一，东西能用。\n有人等着我腾出舱位，今天的货单比平时短。"
msgstr "A warehouse turnover batch, mixed packaging, but usable cargo.\nSomeone needs my hold cleared, so today's cargo list is shorter than usual."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_03603F80C59F"
msgid "仓库库存未实际减少，本次未结算。请检查可取库存、订单预留和最小转移量。"
msgstr "Storage stock did not actually decrease; no settlement was made. Check withdrawable stock, order reservations and the minimum transfer amount."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_7C0025557708"
msgid "件"
msgstr "units"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_91F4C95C5D2D"
msgid "低声礼貌，常用味道和菜单作比喻，敏感问题前会停顿"
msgstr "Speaks softly and politely, using flavors and menus as metaphors; pauses before sensitive questions"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_A0C7716669B5"
msgid "你"
msgstr "You"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_B3B517B1ADD1"
msgid "你什么时候离开？"
msgstr "When are you leaving?"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_B9713D5F8C65"
msgid "你这边最缺什么？我很好奇这一站的需求。"
msgstr "What do you need most here? I am curious about this stop's demand."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_DC250D800099"
msgid "供应商刚到访，当前仅有一个报价点；经过下一周期后形成折线。"
msgstr "This supplier just arrived and has only one quote point. A line will form after the next cycle."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_C43BEEC96533"
msgid "供应商的该商品已售罄。"
msgstr "This supplier has sold out of this item."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_79FFE8D3B8D8"
msgid "供应商通讯 · "
msgstr "Supplier comms · "

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_019B711ECE85"
msgid "供货"
msgstr "Supply"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_13E43251E905"
msgid "供货商"
msgstr "Supplier"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_9541A35779CD"
msgid "供货商已离开，请重新选择。"
msgstr "The supplier has left. Please select another."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_6EB4DB9ED927"
msgid "供货商无库存，或网络没有可接收容量。"
msgstr "The supplier has no stock, or the network has no receiving capacity."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_ECCDD2885283"
msgid "供货商本次停留的交易额度已耗尽。"
msgstr "The supplier's trading budget for this visit is exhausted."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_223963F053C4"
msgid "依次切换：全部、可买入、可卖出。"
msgstr "Cycle through: all, available to buy, available to sell."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_6F025EEA3352"
msgid "保护供应渠道，比眼前的小额利润更看重客户是否守口如瓶。"
msgstr "Protecting the supply channel matters more than a small profit; values customers who keep confidences."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_F0414C169A43"
msgid "保护幕后厨师和供货关系，通过克制的暗示识别可信客户。"
msgstr "Protects the cooks and supply relationships behind the scenes, using subtle hints to identify trustworthy customers."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_ABB3B99B4031"
msgid "保持原来的报价"
msgstr "Keep the original prices"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_45F0AE2749C2"
msgid "保持角色的语气、动机和交往边界。"
msgstr "Maintain the character's voice, motives and interpersonal boundaries."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_4D4D10B89173"
msgid "偏爱尽快出清合适的批次"
msgstr "prefers clearing suitable batches quickly"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_EF66D8F8A650"
msgid "偏远维修站"
msgstr "Remote repair station"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_24B8915AF7BA"
msgid "偏重高价值金属的小批次周转；愿意与不拖延、能验货的客户议价。"
msgstr "Focuses on small batches of valuable metal; willing to negotiate with customers who inspect cargo and act promptly."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_78180AB6DF03"
msgid "偶尔自嘲，玩笑之后把规矩说清"
msgstr "Occasionally self-deprecating, then explains the rules clearly"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_81926FC2B232"
msgid "催促与无端指责"
msgstr "Pressure and baseless accusations"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_9609B2545D4C"
msgid "像熟人聊天，用维修与周转的故事避开敏感问题，不轻易正面否认"
msgstr "Chats like an acquaintance, using repair and turnover stories to evade sensitive questions without direct denial"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_2C492158B178"
msgid "先确认一下需求，再看看我能提供什么。"
msgstr "Let us confirm your needs, then see what I can offer."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_1A4101991A86"
msgid "克制讲究"
msgstr "Reserved and particular"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_458F15FAC955"
msgid "兑现交接约定"
msgstr "Honoring handover agreements"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_5C55A67935AF"
msgid "全部"
msgstr "All"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_844E41354D42"
msgid "公开事实与作者设定分开；作者设定不等于允许公开的内容。"
msgstr "Keep public facts separate from author knowledge; author knowledge is not permission to disclose it."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_039AB11143AE"
msgid "公开转述私下的话"
msgstr "Repeating private conversations publicly"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_93CFA6834E09"
msgid "关闭窗口可稍后继续；供应商离站后，本次通讯结束。"
msgstr "Close the window to continue later; this conversation ends when the supplier leaves."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_4FD3D88204BD"
msgid "再问问这批货的来历"
msgstr "Ask more about where the cargo came from"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_EE4C3BCFFB6B"
msgid "冷静、警觉、重承诺"
msgstr "Calm, watchful and true to promises"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_D82896B8E6FF"
msgid "准确的账目"
msgstr "Accurate accounts"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_BE55C2A75D1B"
msgid "分类市场事件影响报价。大量买入会推高后续报价，大量卖出会压低报价；供需影响逐周期减弱。供应商补货不会恢复交易额度。"
msgstr "Category market events affect quotes. Bulk purchases raise later prices; bulk sales lower them. Supply-demand effects fade each cycle. Replenishment does not restore trading budgets."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_31250C25328E"
msgid "刚整理完这一站的货单。有几批货不多，报价也和上一周期有些不同。\n你想先聊货物，还是聊成交规矩？"
msgstr "I have just organized this stop's cargo list. Some batches are small, and quotes differ from last cycle.\nShall we discuss the cargo or the trading rules first?"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_24EFCAECDB34"
msgid "利用旧仓库和转运环节取得工业材料，不愿说明所有货物的原始归属。"
msgstr "Acquires industrial materials through old warehouses and transfer points; avoids explaining their original ownership."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_E6B3D9BC208C"
msgid "单价<pos=100>周期涨跌"
msgstr "Unit price<pos=100>Cycle change"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_D998FC91A172"
msgid "卖"
msgstr "Sell"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_FB28BA14091D"
msgid "卖出"
msgstr "Sell"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_7D6C856F7E96"
msgid "卖出数量"
msgstr "Sell quantity"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_5D4C020E4990"
msgid "原料收购加价3%"
