msgid "另一位行商"
msgstr "Another trader"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_1D41AEE9DC0B"
msgid "可以谈公开经历与经营偏好；不编造其他角色的秘密。"
msgstr "May discuss public experiences and trading preferences; do not invent other characters' secrets."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_B59B868B79CD"
msgid "可成交数量低于游戏的最小转移量。"
msgstr "The available quantity is below the game's minimum transfer amount."

