msgstr "Maintains ambiguous but useful contacts, avoids scrutiny of supply channels and turns batches over quickly."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_CAEFF417B18A"
msgid "网络中没有可出售的库存。"
msgstr "The network has no saleable stock."

