msgstr "This supplier does not trade this category."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_8854589C732E"
msgid "该商品符合供应商偏好，收购价已包含3%加价。"
msgstr "This item matches the supplier's preference; the purchase price includes a 3% premium."

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_65902F7B4D6A"
msgid "语速平缓，愿意解释细节"
msgstr "Speaks calmly and explains details patiently"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_C513E9ED18E9"
msgid "说话时整理工具袋"
msgstr "Organizes a tool bag while talking"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_ED1268B4F8DE"
