msgstr "Cautious and meticulous"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_614DD88225F4"
msgid "货单、行情和旅程，你想从哪里聊起？"
msgstr "Cargo, prices and travels—where shall we start?"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.STORAGENETWORK_TRADING.TEXT_F3BC96B5F906"
